      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can protein powder help with hair loss?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Only if your hair loss is linked to low protein or calorie intake, such as telogen effluvium after crash dieting, bariatric surgery or rapid weight loss. In that case, a complete protein powder can help you reach your target. It will not help pattern baldness or alopecia areata, and it will not change anything if you already eat enough protein."
