          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does whey protein cause hair loss?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "There is no good evidence that it does. Whey does not contain hormones, and no human study has shown it raises DHT. The real risk is contaminated supplements spiked with anabolic ingredients, which can speed pattern hair loss in people prone to it. A third-party certified whey avoids that risk."
          }
