          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does creatine cause hair loss?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The evidence does not show that it does. A small 2009 study found creatine raised DHT in rugby players but did not measure hair, and it has not been replicated. A small 2025 trial found no meaningful change in DHT or hair measures. If you are worried or treating pattern hair loss, discuss it with your dermatologist."
          }
        },
