            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Protein fixes a protein shortfall, not hair loss in general.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">If your shedding started two to three months after a crash diet, surgery, illness or rapid weight loss, and your protein intake has been low, adding protein makes sense alongside medical advice. If you already eat enough protein, more will not regrow hair.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="telogen-effluvium" class="scroll-mt-24">
