          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A protein powder can help hair loss in one situation: when shedding is telogen effluvium triggered by eating too little protein or too few calories, as after crash dieting, surgery or rapid weight loss on GLP-1 medication. For that job, a certified, creatine-free complete protein such as Thorne Whey Protein Isolate is the cleanest choice, with egg white or a pea-based blend for dairy-free and vegan diets.
